// range+violin_bo5 · violin — built from the AI-source probe's graded run
// source: ai-source-probe/results.range + violin_bo5.jsonl  ·  builder: build_sfz.py
// filed by the key each take played, not the note it was asked for
// probe verdict for this instrument: TEXTURE ONLY  (on target 21, retunable 65, texture 29, of 115 cells)
// 20 of 25 notes asked for had a steady take (best of 7 takes)
// kept 11 of 25 notes asked for; no steady render of G1, A#1, E2, A#2, E7; E1, C#2, G2, C#3, E3, G4, A#5, C#6, E6, G6, A#6, C#7 sounded on keys already taken
// keys E2–A#6; outer samples stretch at most 12 semitones; no silent gaps
// pitch = the grader's measured pitch (keycenter + tune), not the note asked for.
// onset trim -30 dBFS, 2 ms cushion; 3 ms fade-in.

